WEBVTT

00:04:00.756 --> 00:04:03.676
Except that I thought
about that comment of his

00:04:03.716 --> 00:04:06.356
for literally the next 25 years.

00:04:06.356 --> 00:04:09.916
Why do I find sad music so uplifting?

00:04:09.956 --> 00:04:11.796
And what is it in our culture

00:04:11.836 --> 00:04:14.436
that makes it feel
a fitting subject for a joke?

00:04:14.436 --> 00:04:15.996
And why, even right this minute,

00:04:16.036 --> 00:04:19.996
do I feel an intense desire to assure you
that I love dance music too?

00:04:20.036 --> 00:04:21.356
I really do.

00:04:23.276 --> 00:04:25.516
At first, these were just
interesting questions,

00:04:25.556 --> 00:04:28.836
but as I looked
for the answers over the years,

00:04:28.876 --> 00:04:33.036
I started to realize
that, really, they were the questions.